# Scoped safeguard for this env. The repo-root .gitignore (owned elsewhere
# in this repo) does NOT currently exclude *.tfvars despite comments in
# variables.tf / terraform.tfvars.example / infra/README.md claiming it
# does — see tasks/0002-aws-pilot-infra's report. Until the root .gitignore
# is fixed, this local file is the real safeguard keeping real values
# (emails, account-specific names) out of version control.
terraform.tfvars
!terraform.tfvars.example

# Lambda zip build output (generated by the archive_file data sources in
# main.tf at plan/apply time).
.build/

# Saved `terraform plan -out=...` files. These can embed sensitive values
# (e.g. the env-wake shared secret) in a less-obvious but still
# recoverable form, and are throwaway local artifacts anyway.
tfplan*
